# Valgrind suppressions scoped to the vendored SQLite amalgamation. SQLite is
# heavily exercised upstream and its memcheck reports here are not our concern;
# we want memcheck to police sqlite-vec.c. Extend after the first run if
# additional sqlite3.c-internal stanzas appear.
{
   sqlite3-amalgamation-conditional
   Memcheck:Cond
   ...
   obj:*/sqlite3*
}
{
   sqlite3-amalgamation-value8
   Memcheck:Value8
   ...
   obj:*/sqlite3*
}
